sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant Svc as Chat service
    participant St as Conversation store
    participant Sum as Summariser
    participant M as Model
    U->>Svc: next message in a long thread
    Svc->>St: load the thread
    St-->>Svc: more turns than the context window holds
    alt fits
        Svc->>M: send the whole thread
    else too long
        Svc->>Sum: compress the older turns
        Sum-->>Svc: a summary that preserves the premise
        Svc->>St: store the summary, keep the raw turns
        Svc->>M: summary + recent turns verbatim
    end
    M-->>Svc: reply
    Svc->>St: append the new turn
    Note over St,M: the model is stateless — every turn resends the context, and you pay for it each time
